  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5202.02 “Containment and abatement” means to limit spread and to reduce or remove hazardous material or waste from a site.\n\nSource. #7511, eff 6-23-01, EXPIRED: 6-23-09\n\nNew. #12614-A, eff 8-23-18",
